 Tea","historical_business_count":1},{"category":"Food","historical_business_count":3}],"history":[{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Coffee & Tea, Food","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"w6yF2Y88KhzTld0WXgICtA","review_id":"XfASc8p3Bd2Hq9L49zoWOw","date":"2021-02-20T23:30:40","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9338706731796265,"text_excerpt":"This was a cool lil coffee shop in the CBD. It is tucked down a side street but there was plenty of parking when I went on a Sunday morning. The barista was lovely. I got an iced matcha and ham and cheese croissant, both were pleasant. They had a few seating options inside and a very open feeling space with the exposed brick and high ceiling. I would come here again."},{"business_id":"w6yF2Y88KhzTld0WXgICtA","review_id":"iHhBnWfMJK0jM4p368dlUQ","date":"2020-02-27T06:00:08","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9283575415611267,"text_excerpt":"Alright Bon Ami has won me over and I genuinely believe this coffee shop is one of the top spots in town. The exposed brick, open air concept, plenty of seating, and the nook in the back are all elements that bring a fun and lively vibe to the neighborhood. I've had their cold brew, green matcha, and a cappuccino within my multiple visits. ALL HAVE BEEN AMAZING. The iced green matcha latte was so good and I really enjoyed their pours. Silas makes a solid cup of caffeine and has been great for drink recommendations. I've added this coffee spot to my rotation of weekly spots. Love Cafe Bon Ami."},{"business_id":"w6yF2Y88KhzTld0WXgICtA","review_id":"kXMhIMknVQ7XpkW6B3b1Cw","date":"2021-08-09T16:25:55","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9279584288597107,"text_excerpt":"Superb local coffee shop. Great vibe. Super friendly and helpful barista. Cozy decor. Cold A/C for my preference of hot drinks in the summer. :) And an excellent fresh brown sugar latte. My drink couldn't have tasted better."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"w6yF2Y88KhzTld0WXgICtA","photo_id":"LKZIrc-aeX1_q17HmDB_Kg","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/LKZIrc-aeX1_q17HmDB_Kg.jpg","visual_representativeness":1.0000001192092896}]},"notebook_case":null}
